  "description": "Western Rough is a bold and rugged distressed western font inspired by the legendary Wild West, vintage cowboy culture, weathered saloon signs, and frontier adventures. Featuring strong slab-serif letterforms combined with authentic distressed textures, this font delivers a raw and rustic appearance that instantly evokes the spirit of old western towns and classic Americana.\nCrafted for designers who want to create bold, memorable, and character-filled designs, Western Rough combines vintage western charm with a naturally worn effect that adds authenticity and depth to every project. The distressed details give each letter a weathered look, making it perfect for designs that require a rustic, handcrafted, or aged aesthetic.\nWhether you’re creating western-themed logos, rodeo posters, country music branding, whiskey labels, ranch signage, apparel graphics, packaging, or vintage advertising, Western Rough provides a powerful visual presence that commands attention. Its strong structure ensures excellent readability while maintaining the rough character that makes distressed typography so appealing.\nPerfect for :\nWestern Logos\nCowboy Branding\nRodeo Posters\nCountry Music Events\nWhiskey & Bourbon Labels\nRanch and Farm Branding\nRustic Packaging\nVintage Signage\nT-Shirt Designs",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Western Rough is a bold and rugged distressed western font inspired by the legendary Wild West, vintage cowboy culture, weathered saloon signs, and frontier adventures. Featuring strong slab-serif letterforms combined with authentic distressed textures, this font delivers a raw and rustic appearance that instantly evokes the spirit of old western towns and classic Americana.</p>\n<p>Crafted for designers who want to create bold, memorable, and character-filled designs, Western Rough combines vintage western charm with a naturally worn effect that adds authenticity and depth to every project. The distressed details give each letter a weathered look, making it perfect for designs that require a rustic, handcrafted, or aged aesthetic.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating western-themed logos, rodeo posters, country music branding, whiskey labels, ranch signage, apparel graphics, packaging, or vintage advertising, Western Rough provides a powerful visual presence that commands attention. Its strong structure ensures excellent readability while maintaining the rough character that makes distressed typography so appealing.</p>\n<p>Perfect for :<br>\nWestern Logos<br>\nCowboy Branding<br>\nRodeo Posters<br>\nCountry Music Events<br>\nWhiskey &amp; Bourbon Labels<br>\nRanch and Farm Branding<br>\nRustic Packaging<br>\nVintage Signage<br>\nT-Shirt Designs</p>",
